===Etymology 2===
Frequentative of {{term|pote|lang=en}}, equivalent to {{suffix|pote|er|lang=en}}. Cognate with Dutch {{term|poteren|lang=nl}}, {{term|peuteren||to poke, pry, search|lang=nl}}.

====Alternative forms====
* [[putter]], [[pouter]], [[pudder]], [[pother]]

====Verb====
{{en-verb}}

# {{context|obsolete|lang=en}} To [[poke]] repeatedly.
# {{context|British|lang=en}} To act in a [[vague]] or unmotivated way.
# {{context|British|lang=en}} To move slowly or aimlessly. (Often {{term|potter about}}, {{term|potter around}})

